# Root build output.
/artifacts/
# Nested artifact directories stay ignored by default. This was previously the
# unanchored `artifacts/`, which also matched docs/qa/completion/artifacts/ and
# silently excluded the evidence the completion gate is built on — a
# content-addressed record whose artifact is not in the repository is only a
# signed pointer. Anchoring alone would have un-ignored EVERY nested artifacts
# directory, including the docs/qa/completion-m05/ smoke-test store, so the
# broad rule is kept and only the one directory we publish is negated.
**/artifacts/
apps/windows-agent/data/
apps/windows-agent/screenshots/

# Completion evidence is intentionally versioned. The negation is kept even
# though `/artifacts/` is now anchored, as a defence against a future broader
# pattern re-excluding it by accident.
!docs/qa/completion/artifacts/
!docs/qa/completion/artifacts/**
vm/field-host-config.local.json
